  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "In addition to the various export contexts defined in DOTranslationUtility (INTERNAL, MIGRATE, PUBLIC, ARCHIVE), add support for a new export context (ZARCHIVE) that creates a ZIP archive of an object, with all inline and managed datastreams as individual files in the archive.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Use Atom as the initial, proof-of-concept, manifest format.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
